# 2. Visual Direction

Use a premium dark operations-console aesthetic.

### Overall feel

- futuristic
- professional
- technical
- clean
- high information density without feeling crowded
- subtle glass effects
- strong hierarchy
- restrained gradients
- animated status indicators
- crisp typography
- excellent spacing
- responsive
