# 3. Color System

Use CSS variables so the theme can be changed centrally.

```css
:root {
  --bg-primary: #07111f;
  --bg-secondary: #0b1728;
  --bg-tertiary: #101f33;

  --surface: rgba(15, 30, 50, 0.78);
  --surface-solid: #0f1d30;
  --surface-hover: #142640;

  --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14);
  --border-strong: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.24);

  --text-primary: #f8fafc;
  --text-secondary: #a9b7ca;
  --text-muted: #718198;

  --accent: #63e6be;
  --accent-secondary: #60a5fa;

  --success: #34d399;
  --warning: #fbbf24;
  --danger: #fb7185;
  --info: #60a5fa;
  --purple: #a78bfa;

  --shadow-soft: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
