# 49. Frontend Performance

The frontend should remain fast.

Implement:

- lazy-loaded pages
- memoized expensive charts
- debounced global search
- pagination for incidents
- limited initial result sets
- skeleton loading
- optimistic UI only where safe
- avoid loading entire incident history
- cache dashboard data where appropriate

Do not sacrifice hackathon reliability for premature optimization.

